      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-285261",
      ":question/problem": "When a crowdfunding campaign launched, it had already received $$50$ in donations. An exponential model estimates that at the end of each hour after launch, the total amount of money donated increased by $160%$ of the amount from the previous hour.\n\nWhich of the following equations best represents this model, where $D(t)$ is the estimated total amount of money, in dollars, donated $t$ hours after launch and $t \\le 5$?"
